WEBVTT

00:00:04.790 --> 00:00:07.980
Viewers, we wish you a happy New Year.

00:00:07.980 --> 00:00:14.740
We sincerely thank you for supporting the idols of Four Star Academy over the past year.

00:00:14.740 --> 00:00:18.740
We will do everything in our power to fly to even greater heights.

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:20.870
For this year's Aikatsu Stars...

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:23.620
From the beginning all the way till the very end...

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:24.870
If you would...

00:00:25.180 --> 00:00:27.280
Please continue supporting us.

00:02:03.010 --> 00:02:05.520
Okay, we're good!

00:02:05.520 --> 00:02:07.770
Thank you all as well.

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:13.780
We're finally done with all the filming for New Year's.

00:02:13.780 --> 00:02:16.530
This week has felt like an eternity. {you know what, actually, I like this}

00:02:16.530 --> 00:02:18.780
It really was hectic.

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:23.200
We still have the live shows on 
New Year's Day, so don't relax just yet!

00:02:24.120 --> 00:02:26.660
Don't you worry!

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:28.160
Yuzu-senpai?

00:02:28.160 --> 00:02:33.670
I'll take care of all those live programs, so you girls be sure to rest up!

00:02:33.670 --> 00:02:36.920
But then you'll have way too much on your plate!

00:02:36.920 --> 00:02:39.550
You think? I'll be fine!

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:41.300
Leave it to Yuzu!

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:43.550
Mom, Dad!

00:02:43.550 --> 00:02:45.180
Happy New Year!

00:02:45.180 --> 00:02:47.060
Thanks, same to you.

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:49.440
How many pieces of mochi do you want in your soup? {last year we called it mochi soup}{sounds fine}

00:02:50.900 --> 00:02:52.310
Three!

00:02:52.310 --> 00:02:54.070
Got it.

00:02:54.610 --> 00:03:00.070
Going ten games undefeated, Yuzu has won the annual New Year Hanetsuki Tournament! {or Competitor. this is actually the first time hanetsuki has shown up in our subs. I'll leave a note online}{no self-respecting sports anime sub ever includes senshu in the translation}

00:03:00.860 --> 00:03:04.080
Yuzu-senpai's working hard.

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:08.450
Look out! Yuzu is like a human rocket!

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:11.330
She's been going nonstop since this morning. {whoops}

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:17.840
And tomorrow's the traditional Pass 'em All! 
Freezing-cold New Year Triathlon.

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:20.470
We're lucky all our stuff was pre-recorded.

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:22.720
I'm so grateful to our staff.

00:03:22.720 --> 00:03:28.560
Thanks to them, Subaru-kun was able to set off on his whirlwind worldwide tour.

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:30.980
That's some determination.

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:34.310
Kanata-kun has my sympathy for being dragged along.

00:03:34.730 --> 00:03:39.360
Bon appétit! It's Chef Asahi's special curry mochi soup.

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:43.490
It smells wonderful. You'll make a great husband one day.

00:03:43.490 --> 00:03:45.120
Thanks!

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:52.370
The New Year Triathlon has entered its third and final bicycling phase.

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:56.420
While many competitors have dropped out due to the cold,

00:03:56.420 --> 00:04:02.880
Four Star Academy's Nikaidou Yuzu is 
storming ahead with a commanding lead!

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:11.520
What an amazing, amazing, amazing performance!

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:14.270
Goal!

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:16.270
I won!

00:04:16.270 --> 00:04:18.570
You were incredible.

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:23.990
You've won several other awards these few days—
what compels you to work so hard for them?

00:04:23.990 --> 00:04:25.410
Nikaidou-san?

00:04:36.670 --> 00:04:39.550
Wow! Lily-chan, you're so good!

00:04:39.550 --> 00:04:41.800
Yeah, this is great!

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:49.510
You're very skilled, Shirogane-san.

00:04:49.510 --> 00:04:52.850
Not at all. I simply enjoy drawing.

00:04:56.400 --> 00:04:57.690
A dream...

00:04:57.690 --> 00:04:59.770
I'm glad you're awake.

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:01.360
Lilienne...

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:03.570
My next gig—

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:07.700
You must get more bed rest.

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:09.620
Honestly...

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:13.580
You've pushed yourself too hard attempting to appear on so many programs.

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:15.830
I can still keep going.

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:19.460
No. Though you may have the will, your body cannot keep up.

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:22.090
No, no, no, no!

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:23.420
Absolutely not.

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:28.090
You're a meanie, Lilienne.

00:05:30.510 --> 00:05:34.980
What a mess... what are we supposed to do without Yuzu-chan?

00:05:34.980 --> 00:05:38.060
Why don't we play a recording for all her parts?

00:05:38.060 --> 00:05:40.650
Then the whole thing will be recordings.

00:05:42.650 --> 00:05:44.360
Never fear!

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:49.280
We'll take care of this!

00:05:49.280 --> 00:05:52.740
O-Okay, got it! Everyone, to your stations!

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:28.300
Excellent job, everyone. Let's keep this up for the second half.

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:29.220
Yes!

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:31.720
The rest of the show is a drama.

00:07:31.720 --> 00:07:33.970
Th-This is trouble!

00:07:33.970 --> 00:07:38.310
There are nine parts... and all of them were Yuzu-senpai!

00:07:38.310 --> 00:07:41.230
You mean she planned to play them all by using the time lag? {jikansa? hm...}

00:07:41.230 --> 00:07:46.110
There's no way we could do that, so the best option is to assign us all roles.

00:07:46.110 --> 00:07:48.360
But there's not enough of us.

00:07:48.360 --> 00:07:49.990
What now?

00:07:50.490 --> 00:07:53.070
Knowing what is right and not doing it is a want of courage.

00:07:53.070 --> 00:07:53.860
Huh?

00:07:55.870 --> 00:08:00.080
Shirogane Lily has rushed here to provide her services to the drama!

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:03.790
Lily-senpai?! Is Yuzu-senpai doing all right?

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:05.630
Yes.

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:12.010
But even with you here, we only have six. That's still three short...

00:08:12.010 --> 00:08:14.640
Did you think I arrived unprepared?

00:08:17.050 --> 00:08:18.640
Girls!

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:20.850
Hey, happy New Year.

00:08:20.850 --> 00:08:24.270
Doing a live broadcast for the new year seems like a lot of fun!

00:08:24.270 --> 00:08:26.900
Please allow us to help!

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:28.730
That makes nine of us! {far superior to a certain other nine girl idol group}

00:08:28.730 --> 00:08:29.900
Yeah!

00:08:29.900 --> 00:08:34.030
Great, now we can assign parts and read through the script.

00:08:34.030 --> 00:08:36.530
What in the world is this?!

00:08:36.530 --> 00:08:38.200
It's completely blank!

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:42.290
<b>All Yuzu's ad libbing!</b>

00:08:44.620 --> 00:08:45.750
Now what?

00:08:45.750 --> 00:08:49.210
It's just, there's not even anything to act out...

00:08:49.210 --> 00:08:51.050
That's true...

00:08:52.300 --> 00:08:57.800
When I first began, I held many doubts about my ability to be an idol.

00:08:57.800 --> 00:08:59.430
Lily-senpai?

00:09:01.560 --> 00:09:05.560
It happened just after I enrolled at Four Star.

00:09:06.690 --> 00:09:10.070
They said a new student challenged an upperclassman to a dance battle!

00:09:10.070 --> 00:09:11.780
You're kidding! Is she serious?

00:09:17.620 --> 00:09:19.450
Wow, amazing!

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:20.790
Who's that girl?

00:09:20.790 --> 00:09:23.120
Her name's Nikaidou Yuzu!

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:24.500
Incredible...

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:28.130
Wanna keep going?

00:09:28.130 --> 00:09:29.630
That's enough already.

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:32.130
Mikki, you're really good!

00:09:32.760 --> 00:09:34.380
Hey, "Mikki"?!

00:09:34.380 --> 00:09:36.880
I expected no less, Yuzu.

00:09:36.880 --> 00:09:41.430
You managed to impress not only our fellow first-years, but even our senpai.

00:09:41.430 --> 00:09:44.390
Really? I just think fun is the best.

00:09:44.810 --> 00:09:47.140
You are amazing, Yuzu.

00:09:48.400 --> 00:09:50.610
Just like the sun itself.

00:09:50.610 --> 00:09:53.650
On occasion, you shine too brightly for me to look.

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:57.820
I'm just doing the things I can do.

00:09:59.030 --> 00:10:03.540
And Lilienne, you have things only you can do too!

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:05.290
I'm not so certain.

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:06.790
Well I am!

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:11.040
That book I gave you ended up being perfect.

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:12.800
That book?

00:10:13.300 --> 00:10:19.800
Yuzu helped me to realize that I must do what I am able to.

00:10:19.800 --> 00:10:23.430
She may have given me that book on a whim,

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:28.850
but without question, she saw what it is I could do.

00:10:29.560 --> 00:10:34.190
Now is the time for us all to do what we can, for Yuzu and for ourselves!

00:10:34.190 --> 00:10:35.480
Yes!

00:10:54.710 --> 00:10:57.090
Hello, everyone!

00:10:57.090 --> 00:11:00.340
I'm Nijino Yume, a second grader in elementary school!

00:11:00.340 --> 00:11:03.350
Yume-chan, wait for me!

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:06.390
Good morning, Mahiru-chan.

00:11:06.390 --> 00:11:08.100
Morning, Yume-chan!

00:11:08.100 --> 00:11:10.310
Th-That's a unique artistic choice.

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:11.600
Mahiru...

00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:16.690
Class is starting!

00:11:16.690 --> 00:11:18.940
Let's head to the classroom!

00:11:20.860 --> 00:11:22.620
Morning, everyone!

00:11:22.620 --> 00:11:24.530
Well aren't <i>you</i> late.

00:11:24.530 --> 00:11:27.370
I got here three hours early!

00:11:27.370 --> 00:11:30.000
Very good morning! {to you}

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:33.750
I hate mornings. They make me feel lightheaded.

00:11:33.750 --> 00:11:36.670
Excuse me, Nijino-san and Kasumi-san!

00:11:36.670 --> 00:11:40.630
What is the meaning of arriving late on such an important day?

00:11:40.630 --> 00:11:42.260
Sorry, Class Rep.{I need to watch more anime}

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:44.680
Why's it so important again?

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:49.730
Today's when we get our new 
homeroom teacher, Liliko-sensei. {hmmmm, Lilyko looks pretty awful}{I think Lilyko is fine enough, but you should seriously consider Ririko}

00:11:49.730 --> 00:11:51.640
Oh yeah, I forgot!

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:54.650
That's darn intriguing.

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:56.400
Kizaki-san the delinquent!

00:11:56.400 --> 00:11:59.820
Why are you wearing a middle school uniform in an elementary school?

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:01.490
Got a problem?

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:03.410
N-No, not really...

00:12:05.030 --> 00:12:08.660
I'll teach that new teach how cruel the real world is!

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:09.910
A chalkboard eraser?

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:13.170
It's gonna fall on top of the teacher's head! {I think it sounds sillier}

00:12:15.170 --> 00:12:16.840
She's coming now.

00:12:17.500 --> 00:12:18.670
Just wait!

00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:37.770
I am your new homeroom teacher, Shirogane Liliko!

00:12:37.770 --> 00:12:39.480
She popped out of the floor!

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:43.530
Students, the bacteriologist Hideyo Noguchi once said,

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:49.620
"A genius is someone who studies three times, four times, five times more than others."

00:12:49.620 --> 00:12:53.750
My duty is to make each one of you into a genius!

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:55.540
O-Okay...

00:12:56.380 --> 00:13:01.760
To begin with, I would like to determine your academic levels, so I will be administering a kanji reading test.

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:02.630
What?!

00:13:02.630 --> 00:13:04.550
No one told us about this!

00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:08.050
Be silent!

00:13:08.800 --> 00:13:10.310
Too scary!

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:13.560
Now then, please read the following kanji.

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:17.270
You can't read them?!

00:13:19.190 --> 00:13:23.240
Very well then. I do not consider myself a demon.

00:13:23.240 --> 00:13:25.950
Let's try a few simpler questions.

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:30.700
Can anybody answer these? We will begin with the rightmost word.

00:13:31.450 --> 00:13:33.330
Wha—That opens?!

00:13:33.330 --> 00:13:34.500
Peking!

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:37.460
That's correct! Please read the next one, Saotome-san.

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:39.170
N-Nanking.

00:13:39.170 --> 00:13:43.460
Yes, very good. And now for the last one, Nijino-san.

00:13:44.800 --> 00:13:47.340
Um, T-Tonking?

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:49.090
Wrong! Wrong! Wrong!

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:53.100
The last one's a trick question! It's obviously Tokyo!

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:54.640
That's mean!

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:57.230
I'm afraid all of you must be retested!

00:13:57.690 --> 00:14:00.980
Too scary, I can't stop sh-shaking...

00:14:01.570 --> 00:14:05.490
S-Sensei! Hanazono-san is feeling unwell!

00:14:05.490 --> 00:14:07.700
She is? That's not good.

00:14:07.700 --> 00:14:09.490
Nurse Nanakura! {I figure we just go like this}

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:18.790
Hi, class! I'm your doctor, Nurse Koharu! {HELLLOOOOOOOO NURSE}

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:24.630
N-Nurse Nanakura! It's Kirara-san!

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:27.130
My, that's no good.

00:14:29.380 --> 00:14:30.720
Perhaps you need...

00:14:31.470 --> 00:14:33.390
...an injection? {yes please}

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:40.400
First period is over!

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:44.360
After this commercial, we will be moving to physical education.

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:47.400
Do you understand? Do not touch that dial!

00:14:52.950 --> 00:14:54.410
Hey, Nikaidou!

00:14:54.740 --> 00:14:57.660
Seems like you've hit a rough patch.

00:14:58.000 --> 00:14:59.410
Nikaidou?

00:15:05.050 --> 00:15:08.300
Class, your test today will be jumping a vaulting box.

00:15:08.300 --> 00:15:10.130
Wait, we have another test?

00:15:10.130 --> 00:15:11.680
Be silent!

00:15:13.510 --> 00:15:16.430
Vaulting box, come on!

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:25.690
It's... so big...

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:28.860
What's with this vaulting box?

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:29.950
It's way too big!

00:15:29.950 --> 00:15:33.410
This is much too—way too hard, dude.

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:34.450
For sure.

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:36.950
<i>This is the wall I face.</i>

00:15:36.950 --> 00:15:42.420
<i>Only by overcoming this wall will I truly prove that I am worthy to stand in for Yuzu.</i>

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:48.710
Watch me closely! I will show you exactly how the rookie teacher, Shirogane Liliko, lives her life!

00:16:06.230 --> 00:16:07.610
Lily-senpai!

00:16:08.610 --> 00:16:09.860
Are you okay?

00:16:09.860 --> 00:16:13.570
It's not too late to swap it out for a shorter box!

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:14.740
No...

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:18.910
If I back down now, it would not set a proper example for you.

00:16:18.910 --> 00:16:21.250
Impossible things are impossible! {inheriting the will of Yui}

00:16:21.250 --> 00:16:23.580
Even so, I must...

00:16:25.500 --> 00:16:27.250
Sorry I'm late!

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:48.070
I'm the gym teacher, Nikaidou Yuzuo!

00:16:48.070 --> 00:16:49.400
Glad to be here!

00:16:50.030 --> 00:16:51.400
Yuzu!

00:16:51.400 --> 00:16:54.150
Liliko-sensei, you can leave the rest to me.

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:24.020
That was incredible!

00:17:24.020 --> 00:17:25.270
You're so cool!

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:26.940
I was so surprised!

00:17:26.940 --> 00:17:28.270
I must admit I agree.

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:29.060
Me too.

00:17:29.650 --> 00:17:34.820
I knew that Yuzu was too dazzling for me. I'm a failure as a teacher.

00:17:34.820 --> 00:17:36.820
That isn't the case. {only because Yuzuo has a particular speaking style}

00:17:36.820 --> 00:17:40.830
Liliko-sensei, unlike me, you're an expert in Japanese.

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:47.080
All we have to do is cover for one another's 
deficiencies and guide the students together.

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:58.430
That's right... Everyone has things they're good and bad at.

00:17:58.430 --> 00:18:02.510
What's important is the willingness to complement one another.

00:18:04.140 --> 00:18:06.270
I understand!

00:18:06.270 --> 00:18:08.480
Here's a handkerchief, Yume-chan.

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:10.560
Whoa! When'd you get here, Koharu?

00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:12.610
Goodness gracious. {desuwa}

00:18:12.610 --> 00:18:15.110
Liliko-sensei, Yuzuo-sensei.

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:16.150
Thank you...

00:18:16.150 --> 00:18:18.700
...very much for today!

00:18:18.700 --> 00:18:22.700
There's my pride and joy, Nikaidou!

00:18:22.700 --> 00:18:24.290
What a great story!

00:18:24.290 --> 00:18:25.830
It brought me to tears!

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:28.750
Thank god I was born on this planet.

00:18:28.750 --> 00:18:32.630
That was a fabulous way to ring in the new year.

00:18:32.630 --> 00:18:37.170
All right then! After that fun drama, 
it's time for the first song of the year!

00:18:37.170 --> 00:18:39.630
It's Nijino Yume-chan's performance!

00:18:41.140 --> 00:18:44.140
Nijino Yume, ready to go!

00:19:05.870 --> 00:19:08.000
Dresses can make everyone shine!

00:21:50.160 --> 00:21:51.830
Thank you!

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:53.870
Ah, it's Yume-chan!

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:56.670
She's so cute!

00:22:06.050 --> 00:22:07.090
Subaru.

00:22:08.220 --> 00:22:09.590
I got our tickets.

00:22:09.590 --> 00:22:11.220
Oh, thanks.

00:22:13.430 --> 00:22:16.270
Would it kill you to plan in advance next time?

00:22:16.270 --> 00:22:18.480
Yeah, I got it.

00:22:18.850 --> 00:22:19.940
Hey, Kanata.

00:22:21.440 --> 00:22:23.530
Idols sure are great.

00:23:56.120 --> 00:24:00.120
Making everyone shine is the central concept of Rainbow Berry Parfait.

00:24:00.120 --> 00:24:04.040
There's so much fun in store for Aikatsu this year that I can't contain my excitement!

00:24:04.040 --> 00:24:05.590
That gets me going!

00:24:05.590 --> 00:24:09.340
Let's do our best and work hard for the Aikatsu Ranking Final Tournament!

00:24:10.840 --> 00:24:14.260
Elza-sama! Let's go see the firework show together!

00:24:14.260 --> 00:24:18.350
Certainly. Especially since this may be the last time we can do so.

00:24:18.350 --> 00:24:20.390
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:20.390 --> 00:24:22.060
Diary of Stars.

00:24:22.060 --> 00:24:24.350
Become the first-star idol!
